.TH TAXIPRIJS 1 "2024" "taxiprijs 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
taxiprijs \- Dutch taxi fare calculator TUI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B taxiprijs
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B taxiprijs
is a terminal user interface application for calculating taxi fares in the Netherlands.
.PP
It supports configurable pricing for different passenger groups and uses TOML for configuration.
.SH OPTIONS
.B taxiprijs
does not take any command line options.
.SH KEYBOARD CONTROLS
.TP
.B 1
Calculate fare
.TP
.B 2
Settings
.TP
.B 3
Help/Manual
.TP
.B 4
Initial setup
.TP
.B q
Quit
.TP
.B Tab
Next input field
.TP
.B Shift+Tab
Previous input field
.TP
.B Enter
Submit/Save
.TP
.B Esc
Back/Cancel
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is stored in
.B ~/.taxiprijs/config.toml
.PP
The TOML file can be edited manually or through the Settings screen.
.PP
Example configuration:
.PP
.RS
[[passenger_groups]]
.br
name = "1-4 passengers"
.br
board_fee = 3.50
.br
per_minute = 0.50
.br
wait_minute = 0.50
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.taxiprijs/config.toml
User configuration file
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Calculate a fare:
.IP 1. 3
Start the application
.IP 2. 3
Select option 1 (Calculate Fare)
.IP 3. 3
Enter trip duration in minutes
.IP 4. 3
Enter waiting time in minutes
.IP 5. 3
Enter number of passengers (1-5)
.IP 6. 3
Press Enter to calculate
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Normal exit
.TP
.B 1
Error occurred
.SH SEE ALSO
.BRtoml(5)
